;           draft-ietf-cbor-edn-literals-27, C. Bormann,
;           Universitaet Bremen TZI, 20 July 2026.  Internet-Draft,
;           Intended status: Standards Track, Expires 21 January 2027.
;           Updates: 8610, 8949 (if approved).
;           <https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-ietf-cbor-edn-literals-27.txt>
;
; Locator:  Section 6.1, "Overall ABNF Definition for Concise Diagnostic Notation" (Figure 1). Source text lines 2357-2557, in four regions split at the three RFC page frames the figure crosses.
; Content:  Figure 1: Overall ABNF Definition of CDN -- the complete grammar of Concise Diagnostic Notation, 97 productions.
;
; Source digest (sha256 of the whole cached source text):
;   43cfb1236435a9de62d3c202b7ee653b0f5adbd40d3800bbb9379379dbdbf7e9
;
; Regions in this file (line range -> sha256 of those lines joined by LF):
