;   2469-2516  ( 48 lines)  afa7e28a9ab40fe425bc0285bbc3fc01a3e4faf3ed3da2e936dea2dfc1213cbd
;   2525-2557  ( 33 lines)  2dcf800a93f54dbcaf176ce6ea5107c9eae781dad1e85d0543c0b7c5ee54336e
;
; WARNING, recorded not repaired: the figure crosses a page frame IN THE
; MIDDLE OF A PRODUCTION.  The rule `hexscalar-s` begins at source line
; 2514 and its last two alternatives (`/ "7F"` and `/ HEXDIG1`) fall
; after the page 45/46 frame, at source lines 2525-2526.  A reader who
